  "description": "Find the length of the longest palindromic subsequence in a string.",
  "target": 3,
  "pseudocode": "1. n = s.length\n2. dp = new Array(n).fill(0).map(() => new Array(n).fill(0))\n3. for i = n-1 down to 0:\n4.   dp[i][i] = 1\n5.   for j = i+1 to n-1:\n6.     if s[i] == s[j]: dp[i][j] = dp[i+1][j-1] + 2\n7.     else: dp[i][j] = Math.max(dp[i+1][j], dp[i][j-1])",
